                                "sense_id": "d6239078-217a-3d3e-85b2-5233823c720b",
                                "text": "De professor gaf een inspirerende lezing in de grote collegezaal van de universiteit.",
                                "translation": "The professor gave an inspiring lecture in the large lecture hall of the university.",
                                "english": "The professor gave an inspiring lecture in the large lecture hall of the university."
